<title>ESTONIA: C.BANK FIXINGS FOR AUGUST 14/15.</title>
<headline>C.BANK FIXINGS FOR AUGUST 14/15.</headline>
<dateline>TALLINN 1997-08-14</dateline>
<text>
<p>The central bank on Thursday set</p>
<p>the following exchange rates for August 14/15. The kroon is</p>
<p>pegged at eight kroons to a German mark.</p>
<p>	   August 14/15   August 13/14</p>
<p>    CZK     0.43462	  0.43574</p>
<p>    DKK     2.10067	  2.1013 </p>
<p>    FIM     2.67231	  2.67288</p>
<p>    GBP    23.15425	 23.4322 </p>
<p>    HUF     0.07434	  0.07467</p>
<p>    LTL     3.66321	  3.70014</p>
<p>    LVL    25.07607	 25.27948</p>
<p>    RUR     0.00252	  0.00255</p>
<p>    SEK     1.83632	  1.84862</p>
<p>    UAH     7.91081	  8.98468</p>
<p>    USD    14.6532	  14.8024</p>
<p>    XEU    15.71922	 15.73717</p>
<p>-- Tallinn newsroom, +372 620 9202, reuters@reuters.ee</p>
